1255	\begin{lemma}[Direct sums of conditionally linear functions]\label{lem:cl-func-prod}
1256		\lean{MIPStarRE.QPBT.IsCondLinear.directSum}
1257		\leanok
1258		\uses{def:cl-func, def:register-subspace}
1259		Let $m \ge 1$ be an integer and let $V^{(1)}, V^{(2)}, \dots, V^{(m)}$ be register subspaces of $V$ such that $V = \bigoplus_{j=1}^m V^{(j)}$. Suppose that, for each $j \in \{1, 2, \dots, m\}$, $L^{(j)}$ is an $\ell_j$-level conditionally linear function on $V^{(j)}$. Then the direct sum $L = \bigoplus_{j=1}^m L^{(j)}$, defined by
